{
  "name": "dsh-daily-sticky",
  "version": "0.2.5",
  "description": "每日语音便签 DSH web 插件：浮动便签（勾选/编辑/备注/删除/多行批量）+ AI 智能输入（DSH 当前模型抽取 + 模型选择）+ 查漏（你问没答 / 模型在等你 / 刚完成，补录或忽略打 Tag 去重）+ 未完成顺延（昨天/前天/3天前 灰色下标）+ 周/月环比统计。JSON 按日持久化，重启/关机不丢。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "src/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/index.js",
    "./client": "./src/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ]
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "src",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "dsh.plugin.json",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
